# Testing — home_manager

Read [`.cursor/skills/qa-testing/SKILL.md`](../skills/qa-testing/SKILL.md) before implementing features or bug fixes.

## Required for every feature / bug fix

1. Plan (goal + files from CODEBASE_MAP)
2. Checklist — copy [checklist-template.md](../docs/qa/checklist-template.md) or tick [v1-manual-e2e.md](../docs/qa/v1-manual-e2e.md) IDs; see [v2-feature-inventory.md](../docs/qa/v2-feature-inventory.md) for water / expenses / income / overview
3. Automated tests per [test-map.md](../docs/qa/test-map.md)
4. `flutter analyze && flutter test` pass before PR

## Test placement

| Change type | Required test |
|-------------|---------------|
| Pure logic in `lib/core/domain/` | `test/unit/` |
| UI validation / empty states | `test/widget/` |
| Supabase service call | `test/integration/` or extract + unit test helper |
| User-facing flow | Manual E2E checklist item |

## Extract before testing widgets

Form validation and month-edit logic belong in `lib/core/domain/` — not duplicated inside private `_save()` methods.

## CI

GitHub Actions runs `flutter test` on push to `main`. Do not merge failing tests.
